{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/news/change-of-his-majestys-ambassador-to-the-united-arab-emirates-geraldine-mccafferty","content_id":"66ee5411-5959-4b7f-9b3c-9f54d9ab340a","description":"Mrs Geraldine McCafferty has been appointed His Majesty’s Ambassador to the United Arab Emirates in succession to Mr Edward Hobart","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Mrs Geraldine McCafferty has been appointed His Majesty’s Ambassador to United Arab Emirates in succession to Mr Edward Hobart CMG, who will be leaving the Diplomatic Service.</p>\n\n<p>Mrs McCafferty will take up her appointment during August 2026.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"curriculum-vitae\">Curriculum Vitae</h2>\n\n<p>Full name: Geraldine Mary McCafferty</p>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Year</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Role</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2022 to present</td>\n      <td>Beijing, Deputy Head of Mission</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2019 to 2022</td>\n      <td>FCDO, Director, Policy</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2015 to 2019</td>\n      <td>Bogotá, Minister Counsellor</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2012 to 2015</td>\n      <td>Copenhagen, Minister Counsellor</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2010 to 2012</td>\n      <td>FCO, Private Secretary</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2007 to 2009</td>\n      <td>FCO, Team Leader</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2005 to 2007</td>\n      <td>Sarajevo, First Secretary</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2004 to 2005</td>\n      <td>FCO, Pre-posting Training, including Bosnian Language Training</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2001 to 2004</td>\n      <td>FCO, Desk Officer</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2000 to 2001</td>\n      <td>FCO, Russian Language Training</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1998 to 2000</td>\n      <td>Nicosia, Second Secretary Economics</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1996 to 1998</td>\n      <td>FCO, Desk Officer</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1996</td>\n      <td>Joined FCO</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"contact contact\" id=\"contact_3939\">\n    <p class=\"govuk-body\">Media enquiries</p>\n\n\n    <div>\n        <p class=\"govuk-body govuk-!-margin-bottom-4\">\n          Email <a class=\"govuk-link\" href=\"mailto:newsdesk@fcdo.gov.uk\">newsdesk@fcdo.gov.uk</a>\n        </p>\n\n\n        <p class=\"govuk-body govuk-!-margin-bottom-4\">\n          Telephone 020 7008 3100\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"govuk-body\">Email the FCDO Newsdesk (monitored 24 hours a day) in the first instance, and we will respond as soon as possible.</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Added translation","public_timestamp":"2026-07-07T09:07:23Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["f9fcf3fe-2751-4dca-97ca-becaeceb4b26"],"images":[{"caption":"","content_type":"image/jpeg","sources":{"s216":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4bd2914889d85e75ab40c9/s216_Photo_-_Geraldine_McCafferty.jpg","s300":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4bd291d200ca05e289e645/s300_Photo_-_Geraldine_McCafferty.jpg","s465":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4bd291c5aa1b17abab40c1/s465_Photo_-_Geraldine_McCafferty.jpg","s630":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4bd2914889d85e75ab40c8/s630_Photo_-_Geraldine_McCafferty.jpg","s712":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4bd291c5aa1b17abab40bf/s712_Photo_-_Geraldine_McCafferty.jpg","s960":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a4bd291c5aa1b17abab40c0/s960_Photo_-_Geraldine_McCafferty.jpg"},"type":"lead"}],"political":true},"document_type":"news_story","first_published_at":"2026-07-07T10:07:23+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/change-of-his-majestys-ambassador-to-the-united-arab-emirates-geraldine-mccafferty.ar","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/news/change-of-his-majestys-ambassador-to-the-united-arab-emirates-geraldine-mccafferty.ar","base_path":"/government/news/change-of-his-majestys-ambassador-to-the-united-arab-emirates-geraldine-mccafferty.ar","content_id":"66ee5411-5959-4b7f-9b3c-9f54d9ab340a","document_type":"news_story","links":{},"locale":"ar","public_updated_at":"2026-07-07T09:07:23Z","schema_name":"news_article","title":"تغيير سفير صاحب الجلالة لدى الإمارات العربية المتحدة: جيرالدين ماكافري","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/change-of-his-majestys-ambassador-to-the-united-arab-emirates-geraldine-mccafferty.ar","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/change-of-his-majestys-ambassador-to-the-united-arab-emirates-geraldine-mccafferty","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/news/change-of-his-majestys-ambassador-to-the-united-arab-emirates-geraldine-mccafferty","base_path":"/government/news/change-of-his-majestys-ambassador-to-the-united-arab-emirates-geraldine-mccafferty","content_id":"66ee5411-5959-4b7f-9b3c-9f54d9ab340a","document_type":"news_story","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-07T09:07:23Z","schema_name":"news_article","title":"Change of His Majesty's Ambassador to the United Arab Emirates: Geraldine McCafferty","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/change-of-his-majestys-ambassador-to-the-united-arab-emirates-geraldine-mccafferty","withdrawn":false}],"emphasised_organisations":[{"analytics_identifier":"D1315","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","base_path":"/government/organisations/foreign-commonwealth-development-office","content_id":"f9fcf3fe-2751-4dca-97ca-becaeceb4b26","details":{"acronym":"FCDO","brand":"foreign-commonwealth-development-office","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/621e4de4e90e0710be0354d7/s960_fcdo-